  ### Create Problem
POST http://localhost:7070/api/problems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sum of Two Numbers",
  "statement": "Given two integers, print their sum.",
  "timeLimitMs": 1000,
  "memoryLimitKb": 256000,
  "testCases": [
    {
      "input": "2 3",
      "expectedOutput": "5"
    }
  ],
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "Math",
      "difficulty": "EASY"
    }
  ]
}


